# This repo is PRIVATE and deliberately commits its release keystore +
# key.properties so every CI build signs with the same certificate
# (stable in-place updates; see app/build.gradle.kts). If this repo is
# ever made public, move the keystore to a secret FIRST.
!key.properties
!release/asset-tracker-release.keystore
